				;*	Dev_Init  --							*
				;*									*
				;************************************************************************
				;*									*
				;*	This routine is called to initialize the video driver's state.	*
				;*	It sets up the drivers interrupt vectors (10h and 1Eh), and	*
				;*	sets the video mode per the equipment vector.			*
				;*									*
